================================================================================
## Already-loaded assets have no checkbox; Context becomes Refresh
================================================================================

Context: Feedback on the single Add Data Assets dialog: (1) already-loaded
assets must not be reloadable, so they should have no checkbox; (2) the
Context shortcut is less useful than a Refresh that reloads catalogs/schemas
and the table list from Unity Catalog.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_metadata.html
   Replaced the Context button with `#addDataAssetsRefreshBtn`
   (`data-meta-action="add-assets-refresh"`).
2. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-metadata.js
   - Already-loaded rows render an empty checkbox cell; Select All /
     `computeSelectAllImportState` never selects them; the header checkbox
     only considers rows that still have a checkbox; the selection counter
     counts new assets only.
   - Removed the Context shortcut (`addDataAssetsContext`,
     `useContextLocationForAssets`). Added `refreshAddDataAssets()` which
     clears the UCLocationWidget cache, reloads catalogs (preserving the
     current selection) and re-lists tables for the current schema.
3. docs/user-guide.md
   Step 3 updated for Refresh and non-selectable already-loaded assets.
4. tests/units/front/test_add_data_assets_dialog.py
   Contracts updated for Refresh, no Context, and Select All skipping
   already-loaded assets.

